      "value": "<p><strong>Trivial Physical Mutation, Tolerable</strong></p><p>Your body is covered with sores that weep disgusting pus. Roll on the @Table[hitloc]{Hit Locations} Table to determine which part of the body is affected. Every time you gain this mutation it spreads to a new part of the body. Reduce your Fellowship by -10 if your head is affected.</p>"
